{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2021-09-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'HCA HEALTHCARE NAMES SAMMIE MOSIER CHIEF NURSE EXECUTIVE; JANE ENGLEBRIGHT TO RETIRE AFTER NEARLY 30 YEARS OF SERVICE', 'text': "NASHVILLE, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HCA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE:HCA), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HEALTHCARE PROVIDERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SAMMIE MOSIER WILL ASSUME THE ROLE OF SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF NURSE EXECUTIVE, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1, 2021. SHE WILL SUCCEED JANE ENGLEBRIGHT, PH.D., WHO WILL RETIRE AT THE END OF THE YEAR. THE CHIEF NURSE EXECUTIVE ROLE LEADS THE NURSING AGENDA IN ADVANCING THE PRACTICE OF NURSING AMONG HCA HEALTHCARE'S MORE THAN 90,000 NURSES WORKING IN ITS HOSPITALS,"}